   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MAS291 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Statistics and Probability — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13136 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MAS291 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Statistics and Probability — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13136 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">MAS291</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Statistics &amp; Probability_Xác suất thống kê</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45 contact hours (60 sessions) + 1 hour final exam + 104 hours self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">MAE101 or MAC101</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Lecture,Project based learning,Problem based learning,Social Constructivism,groupwork</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13136</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">8/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">MAS291</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Statistics &amp; Probability_Xác suất thống kê</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45 contact hours (60 sessions) + 1 hour final exam + 104 hours self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">MAE101 or MAC101</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Lecture,Project based learning,Problem based learning,Social Constructivism,groupwork</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13136</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">8/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>Upon finishing the course, students must acquire:<br><br>1. the following knowledge:(ABET a1)<br><br>• The fundamental principles of probability and their applications<br><br>• The frequently used probability distributions.<br><br>• The basics of descriptive statistics<br><br>• The inferences of statistics: parameter estimations, hypothesis testing, regressions &amp; correlations.<br><br>2. the following skills: (ABET a2)<br><br>• Recognize simple statistical models and applied them to solve engineering problems.<br><br>• Use at least one statistical software (Excel, Maxima) for problem solving.<br><br>• Self-study skill. (ABET i)</p>\n<h3>Note from the university</h3>\n<p>&quot;On-going assessment:<br><br>• 03 progress tests: 30% (a1, i)<br><br>• 02 assignments 20% (a2)<br><br>• 01 computer project 15%<br><br>Final Examination 35% (a1, a2)<br><br>Final results 100%<br><br>Completion Criteria: Every on-going assessment component &gt; 0, Final Result &gt;=5 &amp; Final Exam Score &gt;=4 &quot;</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>Upon finishing the course, students must acquire:<br><br>1. the following knowledge:(ABET a1)<br><br>• The fundamental principles of probability and their applications<br><br>• The frequently used probability distributions.<br><br>• The basics of descriptive statistics<br><br>• The inferences of statistics: parameter estimations, hypothesis testing, regressions &amp; correlations.<br><br>2. the following skills: (ABET a2)<br><br>• Recognize simple statistical models and applied them to solve engineering problems.<br><br>• Use at least one statistical software (Excel, Maxima) for problem solving.<br><br>• Self-study skill. (ABET i)</p>\n<h3>Ghi chú của trường</h3>\n<p>&quot;On-going assessment:<br><br>• 03 progress tests: 30% (a1, i)<br><br>• 02 assignments 20% (a2)<br><br>• 01 computer project 15%<br><br>Final Examination 35% (a1, a2)<br><br>Final results 100%<br><br>Completion Criteria: Every on-going assessment component &gt; 0, Final Result &gt;=5 &amp; Final Exam Score &gt;=4 &quot;</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13136\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13136</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13136\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13136</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
